## Notes
- MES = Micro Engine Scheduler - handles GPU command scheduling
- WAIT_REG_MEM = GPU waiting for register/memory operation that never completed
- This is a known issue with AMD GPUs after suspend/resume
- Possible mitigations:
  - Update to latest linux-firmware
  - Try kernel parameter: amdgpu.dpm=0 (disable power management)
  - Try kernel parameter: amdgpu.runpm=0 (disable runtime PM)
  - Check for BIOS/EC updates for Framework 16

## WiFi Status at Time of Freeze
- MT7925: NO ERRORS - WiFi was working normally
- Last MT7925 event was hours earlier (Jan 13 22:10)
- This crash is unrelated to WiFi patches
